  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Mass of methane required to produce <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>22</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi></math> after complete combustion is g. (Given Molar mass in g mol<sup>-1</sup>,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The molecular mass of methane  is <strong><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></math>.</strong></p><p>The reaction is as follows,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>Moles of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>mass</mtext><mtext>molar mass</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>22</mn><mn>44</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>So, required moles of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext> Mass of CH</mtext><mtext>4</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>16</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo> </mo><mi>gm</mi></math></p>"
  }
